description:
Job Summary:
The iOS Developer plays a key role in the design, development, and implementation of cutting-edge iOS applications. This position offers an exciting opportunity for individuals with a passion for mobile app development to contribute to high-impact projects and collaborate with cross-functional teams.
Duties and Responsibilities:
 - Brainstorms solutions and ideas for any given problem;
 - Collaborates with cross-functional teams to define, design, and ship new features.
 - Translates designs and wireframes into quality code;
 - Implements design and building applications, modules, and API (REST) for the iOS platform;
 - Designs, builds and maintains reusable and reliable code;
 - Continuously discovers, evaluates, and implements new technologies to maximize development efficiency;
 - Conducts unit test code for robustness, which includes but not limited to the following:
 - Edge cases;
 - Usability;
 - General reliability; and
 - Build and Upload to App Store
 - Provides support and conducts problem solving and bug fixing.

